OL,3,GNEWSACouple's charity walk in honour of
OL,4,Alost twin
OL,5,
OL,6,FCody Mellor and Dean Middleton were
OL,7,Fthrilled to find out they were
OL,8,Fexpecting twins after years of
OL,9,Ffertility treatment, but their joy
OL,10,Fturned to devastation when at 33 weeks
OL,11,Fone of the babies' hearts stopped
OL,12,Fbeating.
OL,14,FThe couple, from Rotherham, had been
OL,15,Ftrying for a child for five years,
OL,16,Fafter Cody had suffered with polycystic
OL,17,Fovary syndrome.
OL,19,FBut, while on the waiting list to start
OL,20,FIVF treatment, Cody fell pregnant in
OL,21,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
